OL,3,GNEWSACommunity rallies after homes
OL,4,Agutted by huge fire
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm lucky that my house is all right
OL,7,Fconsidering they've lost everything,"
OL,8,Fsaid Hazel Tompkins, as she stands in
OL,9,Fthe scorched remains of her garden.
OL,11,FJust over a week ago, four houses in
OL,12,Fher Kings Norton neighbourhood were
OL,13,Fcompletely gutted when a major fire
OL,14,Fspread through parts of Hillmeads Road,
OL,15,FBirmingham, on 13 August.
OL,17,FAs the devastated residents scramble to
OL,18,Frebuild their lives, a
OL,19,FStourbridge-based charity has raised
OL,20,Fmore than #4,000 to support them.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
